      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joiner%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Route 61 runs through Joiner’s center, linking it to Osceola 19 miles northeast and Turrell 12 miles southwest.",
